== Background ==
The primary elections were held on March 5, 2024. Early voting began on February 20.<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-02-19 |title=Arkansas 2024 primary election voter guide {{!}} Candidates & how to vote |url=https://www.thv11.com/article/news/politics/elections/arkansas-2024-primary-election-voter-guide-what-to-know/91-f89e56b6-6141-460c-9318-863b1e956424 |access-date=2024-02-19 |website=thv11.com |language=en-US}}</ref>

